The DPTX reset lines are optional, but provider and deferred-probe errors must not be retained as error pointers and silently skipped.  Use the optional reset API and propagate lookup failures.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/trilin_dptx.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/trilin_dptx.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/cix/dptx/trilin_dptx.c
